{
  "entries": [
    {
      "offset": "0x27a7b5",
      "back_en": "Nnh...?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Interjeição equivalente."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x27aa5f",
      "back_en": "...Are you certain about this?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x27ac10",
      "back_en": "Haha... A cold assessment, milord...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x27ac75",
      "back_en": "rid myself of that bothersome Guardia.",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'guardian' deveria ser 'Guardião'; 'Guardia' parece erro/grafia inconsistente."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x27ad8b",
      "back_en": "Nhargh!?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Interjeição equivalente."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x27ae27",
      "back_en": "Bokoinante! Where is the enemy coming from!?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x27af40",
      "back_en": "And, over all of this...",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'on top of that' é idiomático; melhor 'ainda por cima/além disso' que o literal 'por cima de tudo isso'."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x27af57",
      "back_en": "O unhappy fortune!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x27b1ae",
      "back_en": "No... perhaps this is what she meant.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x27b1d4",
      "back_en": "Miss Munechika...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x27b27f",
      "back_en": "his will.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel; ambiguidade de posse mantida."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x27b313",
      "back_en": "change this.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x27b380",
      "back_en": "Perhaps... this entire invasion was a mistake...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x279ee7",
      "back_en": "A great road leads inland from the shoreline--",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x27a2ec",
      "back_en": "Generals.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x27ac3d",
      "back_en": "Also?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x27aeb1",
      "back_en": "pathways, utterly unknown to the Yamatans.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'os de Yamato' transmite 'Yamatans' adequadamente."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x27b0aa",
      "back_en": "We can neither attack nor retreat.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Sentido preservado."
    }
